    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fungi Fantastico is a fun first person platforming adventure set in a vibrant mushroom filled world. Play as a druidic nature-magic staff wielder who is dealing with a toxic fungal infestation in your peaceful valley. Set off on an adventure to purge the corruption and learn some new tricks along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop Mushrooms, and develop the way you move through the world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where mushrooms on the ground can be popped with your nature beam to give you various buffs, making you move and jump higher to faster traverse the environment. Along with that, gain skills to improve your movement, double jumps, dashes and gravity control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful environments and chill lofi/ambient music made just for the game await you in this adventure to kick back and relax with after a tough day. Escape with the Fungi, in Fungi Fantastico ~</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fungi Fantastico is a fun first person platforming adventure set in a vibrant mushroom filled world. Play as a druidic nature-magic staff wielder who is dealing with a toxic fungal infestation in your peaceful valley. Set off on an adventure to purge the corruption and learn some new tricks along the way. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pop Mushrooms, and develop the way you move through the world:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A game where mushrooms on the ground can be popped with your nature beam to give you various buffs, making you move and jump higher to faster traverse the environment. Along with that, gain skills to improve your movement, double jumps, dashes and gravity control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful environments and chill lofi/ambient music made just for the game await you in this adventure to kick back and relax with after a tough day. Escape with the Fungi, in Fungi Fantastico ~</p>",
    "short_description": "Fungi Fantastico is a first person platforming adventure set in a vibrant mushroom filled world. Play as a druidic nature-magic staff wielder who is dealing with a toxic fungal infestation in your home. Set off on an adventure to purge the corruption and learn some new tricks along the way.",
